+*   **Termination Condition:** The system should stop increasing $s$ when the distortion $\Psi$ increases rapidly. This occurs when most less important regions are already well-squeezed, and no more space is available for features [S1].
+*   **Matrix Updates:** The coefficient matrix $A$ changes frequently with transfer function adjustments or edge flips. Using an expensive factorization step for every change is inefficient [S1].
